<title>INDIA: India ACC H1 96/97 net seen down 6.1 pct.</title>
<headline>India ACC H1 96/97 net seen down 6.1 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India's largest cement maker Associated Cement Companies (ACC) is expected to post a 6.1 percent fall in net profit for the first six months of 1996/97 (April-March), a Reuters poll of major securities firms found.</p>
<p>The average of the profit figures polled by the participants amounted to 1.18 billion rupees, down from 1.2 billion rupees in the year ago period.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>ACC    ----PAT seen down 6.1%, sales up 3.9%</p>
<p>				  (in millions of rupees)</p>
<p>				NET PROFIT		   SALES</p>
<p>			 H1 96/97  H1 95/96     H1 96/97   H1 95/96</p>
<p>-------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Average		1,178.83  1,255.70    11,603.44  11,163.90</p>
<p>High		   1,509.00		  13,444.00</p>
<p>Low		    1,000.00		   9,675.00</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom +91-22-265 9000</p>
